T*
(After confirming this project flashes and reports PSRAM correctly, the next) Tj
T*
(task should be a minimal panel-on + touch test screen.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Cloud Reconciliation Policy \(Current Firmware\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(When an RFID card is scanned and cloud is enabled, the device runs a) Tj
T*
(reconciliation pass before training:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Pull latest user profile \(`usersByRfid/{uid}`\).) Tj
T*
(2. Pull latest calibration \(`calibrations/{uid}/{machineTypeId}`\).) Tj
T*
(3. Pull latest machine config \(`machineConfigs/{machineId}`\) during poll cycle.) Tj
T*
(4. Merge conflict rule:) Tj
T*
(   - If cloud timestamp is newer, local profile/calibration is updated.) Tj
T*
(   - If local timestamp is newer, local data is pushed back to cloud.) Tj
T*
(5. Session uploads are idempotent:) Tj
T*
(   - deterministic paths by `sessionId` and timeline key) Tj
T*
(   - payloads include `schemaVersion` and `idempotencyKey`.) Tj
T*
ET
